WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 8]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:36.790 --> 01:38.020
If I were writing this play,

01:38.790 --> 01:39.660
the shadow would be this man,

01:40.430 --> 01:41.330
Yin Changsheng himself.

01:44.350 --> 01:45.820
He probably took one of his own pills

01:46.590 --> 01:48.130
and became neither human nor ghost.

01:52.480 --> 01:53.460
Quite a show

01:54.000 --> 01:55.100
has unfolded in this tower.

02:24.750 --> 02:27.940
Squire Wang donated 300 liang of silver.

02:28.590 --> 02:31.610
Squire Zhang donated a pair of ruyi scepters.

02:45.310 --> 02:45.980
I don't believe it.

02:46.910 --> 02:47.730
There must be

02:47.750 --> 02:49.130
some plot we haven't noticed.

02:51.310 --> 02:52.570
What other plot could there be?

02:53.150 --> 02:54.010
So many things have happened here

02:54.030 --> 02:54.940
that don't make sense.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.380
My men have vanished,

02:56.870 --> 02:57.850
and you can't catch up with yours.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.290
We closed our eyes,

02:59.470 --> 03:00.820
and we all ended up in another space.

03:01.150 --> 03:02.010
Once you admit

03:02.120 --> 03:03.660
Yin Changsheng's tricks really work,

03:04.840 --> 03:05.850
everything makes sense.

03:06.960 --> 03:07.940
What other answer

03:09.030 --> 03:10.380
could there possibly be?

03:22.470 --> 03:23.890
I don't believe any of it.

03:29.910 --> 03:33.890
Tiezui, how I miss you!

03:39.840 --> 03:40.610
Master Zhang?

03:42.000 --> 03:42.690
Laogou?

03:46.310 --> 03:47.220
Stinky Yu?

03:48.750 --> 03:49.220
Eighth Master.

03:52.430 --> 03:54.220
Stinky Yu, am I glad to see you!

03:55.280 --> 03:56.010
Let's find the others.

03:56.240 --> 03:56.660
All right.

03:57.850 --> 03:58.380
Let's go.

04:06.240 --> 04:07.170
They really made it down here!

04:17.830 --> 04:18.450
What happened?

04:27.280 --> 04:28.570
The hair on that mural was poisonous.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.020
It shouldn't be too serious.

04:32.560 --> 04:33.770
I've survived Blood Corpse poison before.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.860
Let's hurry and meet up with them.

04:48.950 --> 04:49.820
The poisoning isn't severe,

04:50.910 --> 04:51.890
but your pulse is too fast.

04:54.590 --> 04:55.540
Rest here.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.330
I'll go find Tiezui.

04:57.670 --> 04:59.330
Don't move until I return.

06:43.190 --> 06:43.980
Runty.

06:45.600 --> 06:46.370
Runty.

07:23.360 --> 07:24.050
An illusion...

07:25.040 --> 07:25.930
This is an illusion.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.100
Enough of these tricks.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.980
Yin Changsheng, what do you want?

07:54.240 --> 07:54.660
Laogou.

07:56.040 --> 07:56.660
Laogou!

07:58.190 --> 07:58.700
I'm coming.

07:59.950 --> 08:00.730
I'm coming to you.

08:08.390 --> 08:08.930
Xiaoyu.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.900
- Master! - Master Zhang!

08:14.360 --> 08:16.780
My dear Master Zhang!

08:16.830 --> 08:19.610
Master Zhang, I've missed you so much!

08:20.480 --> 08:21.490
My dear Master Zhang,

08:22.120 --> 08:24.410
we've searched everywhere for you.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.220
Are you all right?

08:27.310 --> 08:28.050
Are you hurt?

08:28.120 --> 08:28.930
I'm fine.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.650
Thank goodness.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.370
Where's Laogou?

08:38.120 --> 08:38.890
He's been poisoned,

08:39.440 --> 08:40.180
but he's out of danger.

08:40.550 --> 08:41.730
He's resting elsewhere for now.

08:43.150 --> 08:43.770
Good.

08:44.200 --> 08:44.580
By the way,

08:45.080 --> 08:45.580
just now,

08:46.000 --> 08:47.940
we got a message from Laogou's bird, Tu.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.730
So it really is some kind of visual trick.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.060
Otherwise,

08:52.480 --> 08:53.730
Tu couldn't have flown from where you were

08:53.840 --> 08:55.010
and made it back to us.

08:55.390 --> 08:56.220
If it's a trick,

08:56.390 --> 08:57.060
that makes things easier.

08:57.270 --> 08:58.180
It doesn't, Master Zhang.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.460
We've searched all this way,

08:59.510 --> 09:01.420
but still haven't figured out how the mechanism works.

09:07.750 --> 09:09.130
Isn't that Laogou's whistle?

09:11.150 --> 09:13.010
Didn't you say he was resting?

09:13.440 --> 09:14.650
He always does as he pleases.

09:15.200 --> 09:15.580
Xiaojin.

09:15.960 --> 09:16.250
Yes.

09:16.630 --> 09:18.010
Tell Fifth Master to meet us at the stage.

09:18.270 --> 09:18.820
The rest of you, follow me.

09:19.000 --> 09:19.220
Yes.

09:19.440 --> 09:19.650
Hurry.

09:43.870 --> 09:45.580
This is where the Three Worms were hiding.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.130
"Madam Wang's Lecture"?

09:51.960 --> 09:52.980
This play isn't that old.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.980
It was originally a story in Li Yu's "Silent Dramas"

09:55.550 --> 09:57.420
and wasn't adapted for the stage until the 15th year of Guangxu.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.580
Then that means

10:00.600 --> 10:01.890
this place was built in the Qing dynasty.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.700
Yin Changsheng built it.

10:04.360 --> 10:05.530
Yin Changsheng?

10:09.120 --> 10:09.610
Master Zhang,

10:10.240 --> 10:10.650
then this...

10:10.960 --> 10:12.420
this stage is no ordinary one.

10:15.390 --> 10:15.890
Follow me.

10:24.030 --> 10:24.580
Miss Huo.

10:30.120 --> 10:30.530
Let's go.

10:41.600 --> 10:45.300
- Master! - Master!

10:45.320 --> 10:45.890
Heifeng.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.060
Juanlian.

10:48.320 --> 10:48.840
Are you all right?

10:48.840 --> 10:49.350
We're fine.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.180
Xiangu.

10:52.030 --> 10:52.460
Xiangu!

10:57.150 --> 10:57.610
Laogou,

10:58.440 --> 10:59.100
what happened to you?

11:00.480 --> 11:01.460
I heard your whistles,

11:01.670 --> 11:02.610
so I came to meet you.

11:03.080 --> 11:03.770
It's dangerous here.

11:03.960 --> 11:04.700
This place is dangerous!

11:04.750 --> 11:05.370
Where's Zhang Qishan?

11:07.360 --> 11:08.060
We got separated.

11:08.510 --> 11:09.420
I got separated from him.

11:10.030 --> 11:10.610
Master,

11:11.030 --> 11:12.490
you seem a little...

11:13.080 --> 11:13.530
Poison.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.610
There's poison here.

11:15.910 --> 11:16.610
Don't touch anything.

11:18.910 --> 11:19.370
Master,

11:20.150 --> 11:21.460
why don't you rest for a while?

11:23.320 --> 11:24.130
I'll get you out.

11:24.720 --> 11:25.580
I have to get you out.

11:26.000 --> 11:26.890
I'm really worried.

11:27.790 --> 11:28.940
What's happened here?

11:29.960 --> 11:30.490
Yes...

11:31.480 --> 11:32.220
I need to get you out.

11:32.670 --> 11:33.730
Your lives matter more than mine.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.100
I'll get you out.

11:35.510 --> 11:36.370
I'll get you out.

11:36.750 --> 11:37.490
Where's the exit?

11:37.840 --> 11:38.730
Where's the exit?

11:40.630 --> 11:41.180
Miss Huo,

11:42.120 --> 11:43.100
what's...

11:44.270 --> 11:45.250
what's wrong with Master?

11:46.750 --> 11:47.820
He is acting rather strangely.

11:59.550 --> 12:00.060
Tiezui,

12:01.150 --> 12:03.490
is that man up there Yin Changsheng?

12:06.670 --> 12:07.770
That tall hat

12:09.030 --> 12:11.890
and the entire abode built on a great ghost...

12:13.270 --> 12:15.100
It really is Yin Changsheng, Master Zhang.

12:17.670 --> 12:20.340
No wonder this place is so strange.

12:21.440 --> 12:22.250
It was built

12:22.270 --> 12:23.850
in the image of Fengdu.

12:25.600 --> 12:26.940
If it really is him,

12:28.630 --> 12:29.820
we're in serious trouble!

12:30.790 --> 12:32.770
Stop being mysterious. Speak plainly.

12:34.750 --> 12:35.300
Master Zhang,

12:35.870 --> 12:36.820
this immortal

12:36.870 --> 12:37.730
was rather peculiar

12:38.080 --> 12:38.940
and loved playing tricks.

12:39.670 --> 12:40.130
And

12:41.000 --> 12:42.130
look at the layout.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.030
This seems to be his tomb.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.060
Could he be

12:46.630 --> 12:47.650
buried here?

12:50.390 --> 12:51.530
This doesn't look like an ancient tomb.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.300
It seems to be a place for studying magic.

12:54.750 --> 12:55.100
Master Zhang,

12:55.360 --> 12:56.850
that's where you're mistaken.

12:57.960 --> 12:59.130
A mystic's tomb

12:59.440 --> 13:01.010
and a place for studying magic

13:01.510 --> 13:03.060
are often indistinguishable.

13:03.910 --> 13:06.650
So was he a mystic or an immortal?

13:08.030 --> 13:09.340
According to folklore,

13:09.600 --> 13:10.490
he was certainly an immortal.

13:11.480 --> 13:12.060
But

13:12.840 --> 13:14.130
what the truth was

13:15.150 --> 13:16.820
can no longer be verified.

13:20.150 --> 13:20.850
Take a look

13:21.200 --> 13:21.850
at these vats

13:23.390 --> 13:24.530
and tell me what the symbols mean.

13:29.670 --> 13:30.980
These symbols

13:32.720 --> 13:34.180
are all suppression talismans.

13:35.240 --> 13:37.300
There must be something evil sealed inside the vats.

13:38.670 --> 13:40.130
These lids must never be opened.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.130
That's it?

13:46.320 --> 13:47.460
Well, I...

13:49.000 --> 13:50.180
I'll go study the mural.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.420
We've already done that.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.250
You have?

13:58.030 --> 13:59.820
So you and Laogou

13:59.960 --> 14:01.130
have seen everything worth seeing?

14:02.120 --> 14:03.220
Then let's leave.

14:03.910 --> 14:05.460
If we find the mechanism and get out within two hours,

14:06.270 --> 14:07.610
we can still make it back for dinner.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.580
It seems you refuse to use your real skills.

14:11.200 --> 14:13.010
Then it makes no difference whether you're here or not.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.420
Spread the word:

14:14.550 --> 14:16.060
Eighth Master looks down on me, Zhang Qishan.

14:16.240 --> 14:16.890
Did everyone hear that?

14:18.630 --> 14:19.650
Master Zhang...

14:20.720 --> 14:21.770
Master Zhang,

14:22.510 --> 14:22.980
look at me.

14:25.120 --> 14:27.490
My eyes are practically glowing.

14:27.870 --> 14:28.420
Rest assured.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.650
I promise I'll find something useful.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.530
Let me check the layout.

15:02.670 --> 15:03.300
Master Zhang,

15:06.000 --> 15:06.890
does the mural

15:07.550 --> 15:08.730
show a stage?

15:12.360 --> 15:13.460
The mechanism that leads us out

15:13.630 --> 15:14.980
is hidden in the stage.

15:29.150 --> 15:30.610
Military manual on the left, wooden sword on the right.

15:30.720 --> 15:32.180
Have Madam Wang hand them over. Quick.

16:34.390 --> 16:34.820
Master,

16:35.080 --> 16:35.770
a door opened.

16:38.080 --> 16:38.580
Continue.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.850
Give the abacus to the son.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.220
The ledger goes to Madam Wang.

16:44.390 --> 16:45.010
Open it to a page,

16:45.150 --> 16:46.060
as though she's teaching him bookkeeping.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.140
Master, another door opened.

17:18.110 --> 17:19.140
Two doors really did open.

17:19.480 --> 17:20.770
Impressive, Eighth Master.

17:23.310 --> 17:24.300
People

17:24.990 --> 17:26.730
are so caught up in the classics,

17:27.440 --> 17:30.050
yet they forget there are countless trades,

17:30.320 --> 17:32.020
and every trade has its masters.

17:36.120 --> 17:36.570
Master Zhang,

17:36.880 --> 17:38.330
we now have two paths.

17:38.990 --> 17:41.010
One is probably safe, the other deadly.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.690
Which one do we take?

17:43.390 --> 17:44.580
Which do you think we should take?

17:49.480 --> 17:50.980
- I think we should... - This one, then.

17:52.160 --> 17:52.380
Wait.

17:53.200 --> 17:53.570
Master Zhang!

17:57.350 --> 17:59.010
Master Zhang, aren't we waiting for Laogou?

17:59.550 --> 18:00.460
Xiangu can look after him.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.220
Leave him a sign.

18:11.380 --> 18:13.220
[Nine]

18:13.510 --> 18:14.180
- Zhang Qishan! - Master Zhang!

18:14.960 --> 18:15.380
Master Zhang!

18:16.110 --> 18:16.660
- Zhang Qishan! - Master Zhang!

18:16.750 --> 18:17.330
Master Zhang!

18:19.640 --> 18:20.180
Master Zhang!

18:23.110 --> 18:24.570
We agreed to meet at the stage.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.250
Where is everyone?

18:29.830 --> 18:30.250
Laogou,

18:31.240 --> 18:32.380
could Master Zhang and the others

18:32.400 --> 18:34.010
have gone through these two openings?

18:35.550 --> 18:36.700
Zhang Qishan left without me?

18:38.680 --> 18:39.420
These two openings

18:41.110 --> 18:41.900
weren't here before.

18:46.550 --> 18:47.660
There's no other way out,

18:48.400 --> 18:49.220
so let's go in first.

18:57.480 --> 18:57.940
This way.

19:05.880 --> 19:06.420
Master,

19:07.200 --> 19:08.420
what happened earlier?

19:08.720 --> 19:09.770
This place is deeply sinister.

19:10.270 --> 19:11.250
As soon as we find a way out,

19:11.510 --> 19:12.250
we'll leave.

19:12.310 --> 19:12.900
Laogou.

19:13.640 --> 19:14.050
Laogou.

19:17.350 --> 19:17.980
Calm down.

19:24.590 --> 19:25.530
There's something I need to tell you.

19:39.790 --> 19:40.290
Master,

19:40.640 --> 19:41.420
the hand

19:41.440 --> 19:42.860
we saw in Liunian Hall...

19:43.350 --> 19:44.380
Was it yours?

19:46.960 --> 19:47.620
I don't know.

19:50.030 --> 19:50.900
Then how do you explain

19:51.640 --> 19:52.620
this button?

19:53.350 --> 19:54.250
I really don't know.

19:55.550 --> 19:56.770
But at the time you mentioned,

19:57.270 --> 19:58.900
I was indeed with Zhang Qishan.

19:59.790 --> 20:00.900
So where did this button come from?

20:02.070 --> 20:03.140
And how could that have been my hand?

20:04.510 --> 20:06.180
If someone vanished, we could blame it on spirits clouding our sight.

20:06.590 --> 20:07.980
But how do you explain something

20:08.960 --> 20:09.900
appearing out of nowhere?

20:12.110 --> 20:12.980
We can't waste any more time.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.460
This place is deeply sinister.

20:15.160 --> 20:16.180
Find a way out, quickly.

20:20.270 --> 20:20.730
Master,

20:21.240 --> 20:22.220
that's Runty barking.

20:23.680 --> 20:24.700
You think I can't recognize it?

20:35.640 --> 20:36.090
Master,

20:36.640 --> 20:37.730
that's definitely Runty.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.380
You're all hearing it too, right?

20:39.480 --> 20:40.090
It's Runty.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.180
All right.

20:45.240 --> 20:46.380
Then let's go take a look.

20:47.480 --> 20:48.660
Everyone, stay alert.

20:49.200 --> 20:49.620
Yes.

20:50.510 --> 20:50.940
Let's go.

20:53.030 --> 20:53.700
Stop there!

21:00.310 --> 21:01.730
Tianpeng! Zhenyuan!

21:02.110 --> 21:02.860
Is that you?

21:03.680 --> 21:04.530
Fifth Master!

21:04.790 --> 21:07.010
We're... we're trapped!

21:08.350 --> 21:10.220
Master, it really is Tianpeng and Zhenyuan.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.290
Tianpeng! Zhenyuan!

21:14.920 --> 21:15.250
Don't be afraid.

21:15.680 --> 21:16.860
We'll get you out right now!

21:21.240 --> 21:23.180
Master, save me!

21:25.480 --> 21:27.860
Please save us, Master!

21:40.350 --> 21:41.010
Find the mechanism.

22:02.680 --> 22:03.180
Come here.

22:05.440 --> 22:05.900
Come here.

22:48.510 --> 22:48.980
Master,

22:49.480 --> 22:51.140
how does this mechanism work?

23:07.000 --> 23:08.010
It's a yin-yang lock.

23:09.640 --> 23:10.530
The yang catch is here.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.010
The yin catch is somewhere else.

23:14.680 --> 23:16.420
They must be operated simultaneously to unlock it.

23:19.200 --> 23:20.140
You stay here.

23:20.880 --> 23:21.620
I'll find the yin catch.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.050
Stay alert and follow my whistle.

23:25.160 --> 23:26.180
Once I find the yin catch,

23:26.790 --> 23:27.810
I'll tell you what to do.

23:28.440 --> 23:28.940
- Yes. - Yes.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.140
I'll go with you.

23:32.880 --> 23:33.810
You should stay here.

23:34.830 --> 23:36.530
Runty and the others are still trapped by the mechanism.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.810
The more I think about it, the stranger it seems.

23:40.440 --> 23:42.050
I suspect that shadow is in there too.

23:44.110 --> 23:45.090
Once we disable the mechanism

23:45.440 --> 23:46.140
and the door opens,

23:46.640 --> 23:47.570
I'll need you here to back me up.

23:51.510 --> 23:52.090
Laogou,

23:53.030 --> 23:53.770
be careful.

24:19.480 --> 24:21.730
Zhang Qishan, are you nearby?

24:23.440 --> 24:25.490
My men are trapped! I need your help!

24:27.110 --> 24:27.900
Why is there no answer?

25:12.750 --> 25:13.530
This is the yin catch.

25:32.270 --> 25:34.380
In position. Get ready.

25:45.790 --> 25:46.290
In position.

26:03.640 --> 26:04.180
Three notches left.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.180
Three notches left.

26:23.750 --> 26:24.330
Two notches right.

26:28.750 --> 26:29.290
Two notches right.

26:36.510 --> 26:37.090
One notch left.

26:55.270 --> 26:58.620
Juanlian, I'm... I'm so scared!

27:00.960 --> 27:02.180
Tianpeng, Zhenyuan,

27:02.400 --> 27:03.570
we're about to open the door.

27:03.880 --> 27:05.050
Hang in there!

27:07.720 --> 27:10.530
Good! Hurry!

27:27.550 --> 27:28.330
Two notches left.

27:34.880 --> 27:35.530
Three notches right.

27:41.070 --> 27:41.810
What's going on?

27:42.920 --> 27:44.380
That's not what I whistled.

27:47.110 --> 27:48.770
Wrong. Two notches left.

27:57.510 --> 27:58.180
Three notches right?

28:01.510 --> 28:03.530
Wait. That whistle sounded wrong.

28:11.110 --> 28:12.770
Don't turn it, Juanlian!

28:12.960 --> 28:15.090
Don't! It's deceiving you!

28:24.920 --> 28:26.010
Juanlian, don't turn it!

28:26.880 --> 28:27.980
That whistle is wrong!

29:28.830 --> 29:29.370
Heifeng.

29:30.360 --> 29:31.010
Heifeng.

29:38.820 --> 29:43.420
♪See the moon, indelible as ink...♪

29:43.430 --> 29:44.050
Aolie.

29:45.000 --> 29:45.570
Aolie!

29:47.580 --> 29:50.980
♪Who turns back with a troubled frown?♪

29:51.560 --> 29:52.210
Juanlian!

29:56.540 --> 29:59.500
♪If I could take one bright thread from memory...♪

30:00.670 --> 30:01.210
Xiangu.

30:03.360 --> 30:03.820
Xiangu?

30:04.790 --> 30:05.290
Xiangu.

30:06.150 --> 30:06.620
Xiangu.

30:08.020 --> 30:10.500
♪A true heart has no cause for shame...♪

30:10.510 --> 30:11.130
Xiangu...

30:13.710 --> 30:14.460
Xiangu.

30:17.580 --> 30:19.860
♪I drink a cup of rough wine♪

30:19.860 --> 30:25.020
♪Right and wrong pass with the changing seasons♪

30:25.420 --> 30:29.420
♪My heart unchanged, I have no regrets♪

30:29.420 --> 30:34.780
♪However the past may have twisted and turned, I regret nothing with you♪

30:35.660 --> 30:41.940
♪When a thousand sails ride wind and waves home, I'll sail with you again♪

30:41.940 --> 30:48.340
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

30:48.700 --> 30:54.540
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

30:54.740 --> 31:00.540
♪However the past may have twisted and turned, I regret nothing with you...♪

31:05.880 --> 31:07.580
Tianpeng. Tianpeng!

31:12.040 --> 31:12.580
Zhenyuan.

31:13.320 --> 31:13.930
Zhenyuan!

31:13.980 --> 31:18.500
♪Before the night grows cold, old tales replay a thousand times♪

31:18.780 --> 31:26.500
♪I'll return with you♪

31:28.100 --> 31:33.900
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

31:34.940 --> 31:36.900
♪And get drunk with you♪

32:07.240 --> 32:07.900
You win.

32:10.480 --> 32:12.380
Monster or immortal,

32:13.640 --> 32:15.010
human or ghost,

32:16.830 --> 32:17.770
you win.

32:20.400 --> 32:22.010
But don't get too pleased with yourself.

32:26.310 --> 32:28.330
You won't keep winning forever.

32:37.750 --> 32:39.290
Let's die together!

33:19.480 --> 33:20.570
Burning candles to prolong life.

33:21.680 --> 33:23.860
Why do the two people in this mural look identical?

33:25.160 --> 33:26.330
What do you mean, identical?

33:26.640 --> 33:28.570
This is called "A Miracle Cure."

33:53.200 --> 33:54.330
Burn Candles to Prolong Life.

33:58.550 --> 33:59.530
Ascend to Heaven.

34:01.030 --> 34:01.860
Peer into the Future.

34:02.550 --> 34:03.330
These are the three tricks.

34:03.920 --> 34:04.860
The three tricks.

34:06.350 --> 34:07.420
The trick for ascending to Heaven

34:07.440 --> 34:08.300
is the one we already used.

34:09.190 --> 34:10.460
That's why we ended up in this Underworld.

34:23.880 --> 34:24.980
You showed me this

34:25.120 --> 34:25.910
to remind me

34:25.910 --> 34:27.050
they aren't dead yet, didn't you?

34:27.480 --> 34:28.980
You want to force me to use this trick to save them?

34:30.000 --> 34:30.610
Why?

34:30.840 --> 34:31.370
Why?

34:31.590 --> 34:32.460
What do you want?

34:32.640 --> 34:33.570
What do you want?

34:34.560 --> 34:35.300
Answer me.

34:35.720 --> 34:36.930
This is the second time.

34:37.240 --> 34:37.980
I'm warning you.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.170
This is the second time!

34:39.790 --> 34:40.610
Answer me!

34:40.720 --> 34:41.930
Answer me!

34:58.150 --> 34:59.170
You want me

35:00.430 --> 35:02.170
to try all three tricks,

35:03.550 --> 35:04.260
don't you?

35:27.480 --> 35:28.170
Fine.

35:29.880 --> 35:30.690
This round,

35:31.800 --> 35:32.650
you win.

35:35.190 --> 35:36.300
I'll do it.

36:09.320 --> 36:09.740
Don't be afraid,

36:10.920 --> 36:11.460
Xiangu.

36:13.590 --> 36:14.780
I'll make you well again.

36:38.230 --> 36:39.260
The rest of you too.

36:40.800 --> 36:42.210
None of you are leaving me.

36:43.320 --> 36:45.050
Even if it costs me my life today,

36:46.630 --> 36:48.900
I'll pull you back from the brink of death.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.050
Burning candles to prolong life

36:55.510 --> 36:57.130
requires 49 candles.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.050
The candles contain medicinal herbs.

37:17.030 --> 37:18.420
Combined with other ingredients, they can save lives.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.610
I'll light these candles,

37:43.630 --> 37:44.530
but my people

37:45.480 --> 37:47.050
must all be returned to me.

37:48.400 --> 37:49.010
Otherwise,

37:50.550 --> 37:52.210
you and I will be buried with them!

39:12.400 --> 39:13.690
Which step did I get wrong?

39:17.280 --> 39:18.130
How could this happen?

39:21.000 --> 39:22.210
I've burned the hair

39:23.150 --> 39:24.010
and lit the candles.

39:24.760 --> 39:25.900
Why isn't it working?

39:31.030 --> 39:32.740
Why isn't it working?

39:45.150 --> 39:47.010
Aren't you supposed to heal them?

39:51.630 --> 39:52.460
Where are my people?

39:55.110 --> 39:56.380
Where are my people?

41:03.680 --> 41:04.450
It worked.

41:08.630 --> 41:09.420
I did it.

41:11.800 --> 41:12.500
I did it.

41:45.060 --> 41:49.220
♪The past fades like smoke♪

41:49.580 --> 41:52.300
♪A choice is made in silence♪

41:52.580 --> 41:55.380
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

41:55.780 --> 41:59.540
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

41:59.780 --> 42:03.220
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

42:03.500 --> 42:06.900
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

42:06.980 --> 42:14.260
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

42:14.700 --> 42:17.980
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

42:18.260 --> 42:21.500
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

42:21.660 --> 42:25.700
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

42:25.900 --> 42:29.260
♪Who believes in fate?♪

42:29.500 --> 42:32.860
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

42:33.100 --> 42:36.380
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

42:36.700 --> 42:40.380
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

42:40.580 --> 42:43.820
♪Take care♪

42:43.820 --> 42:46.380
♪We once raced♪

42:46.460 --> 42:48.380
♪For the dawn♪

42:48.540 --> 42:51.820
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

42:51.940 --> 42:55.220
♪In the web of fate♪

42:55.220 --> 42:58.420
♪No one can escape♪

42:59.420 --> 43:01.260
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

43:01.420 --> 43:02.980
♪We too were young once♪

43:03.060 --> 43:06.500
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

43:06.700 --> 43:09.020
♪Keep the ember lit♪

43:09.140 --> 43:13.660
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

43:13.780 --> 43:16.740
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:16.980 --> 43:20.500
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:20.620 --> 43:24.380
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:24.700 --> 43:28.180
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:28.340 --> 43:31.340
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:31.580 --> 43:35.340
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:35.500 --> 43:39.220
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:39.340 --> 43:50.780
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
